Value INDEX (\d+)
Value LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value HOLDTIME (\d+)
Value CAPABILITY ([A-Z,\s]+)
Value NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value NEIGHBOR (\S+)

Start
  ^Index\s+Local\s+Intf\s+Hold-time
  ^${INDEX}\s+${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s+${HOLDTIME}\s+${CAPABILITY}\s+${NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE}\s+${NEIGHBOR}\s*$$ -> Record
